          "settings": {
            "title": "Returns, exchanges and refunds",
            "nav_label": "Returns and refunds"
          }
        },
        "q-2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I start a return?",
            "text": "<p>Email <a href=\"mailto:kontakt@stilhusetnord.dk\">kontakt@stilhusetnord.dk</a> with your order number and the item you'd like to return, within 30 days of receiving it. We'll reply with the return address and short instructions.</p><p>Please wait for our reply before sending anything – packages sent back on your own often end up at a warehouse that can't process them.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q-3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What can I return?",
            "text": "<p>Anything unworn and unwashed, in original condition with the tags still attached, within 30 days of delivery.</p><p>For hygiene reasons we can't accept piercing jewellery once the seal is broken. Faulty items are handled separately – see below.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q-4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "It doesn't fit. Can I exchange the size?",
            "text": "<p>We don't exchange sizes directly. Send the item back for a refund and place a new order in the size you want – that way the size isn't sold to someone else while your package is on its way.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q-5": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Who pays for return shipping?",
            "text": "<p>You do – unless the item was faulty, damaged or not what you ordered. Then we pay.</p><p>Use a tracked shipping service. Until the package reaches us, it's your responsibility.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q-6": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Where should I send my return?",
            "text": "<p>To the address we send you when you start your return – not to the sender address on the package. That's usually a warehouse that can't handle returns, and packages sent there are hard to recover.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q-7": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "My item is damaged or wrong. What now?",
            "text": "<p>Email <a href=\"mailto:kontakt@stilhusetnord.dk\">kontakt@stilhusetnord.dk</a> within 30 days of delivery with your order number and a few photos. We'll send a replacement or refund you – and we pay for the return shipping.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q-8": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Why do you need photos?",
            "text": "<p>With photos we can usually resolve it straight away, without you having to send anything back. They're also what we pass on when we raise the issue with the maker or the carrier.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q-9": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How long until I get my money back?",
            "text": "<p>We refund you within 14 days of receiving your return. After that it usually takes 3–5 business days for your bank to show the amount.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q-10": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do I get my money back?",
            "text": "<p>Yes – to the payment method you used, for the full price of the returned items. If you return a whole order, you also get the standard shipping cost back.</p>"
          }
        },
        "group-11": {
          "type": "group",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Shipping and tracking",
            "nav_label": "Shipping and tracking"
          }
        },
        "q-12": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How long does delivery take?",
            "text": "<p>We pack and ship orders within 3–4 business days. Delivery then takes another 3–6 business days.</p><p>If you order at the weekend or on a public holiday, we start on your order the next business day.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q-13": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Where is my tracking number?",
            "text": "<p>It's emailed as soon as the package ships – so it doesn't exist yet while we're packing your order. You can also follow it on the <a href=\"/pages/track-order\">Track my order</a> page.</p><p>Can't find the email? Check your spam folder before writing to us.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q-14": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "My order is late. What should I do?",
            "text": "<p>Tracking can go quiet for a few days while the package moves between carriers. That alone doesn't mean it's lost.</p><p>If nothing has happened for 7 days, or the expected date has passed, email <a href=\"mailto:kontakt@stilhusetnord.dk\">kontakt@stilhusetnord.dk</a> with your order number and we'll chase it up.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q-15": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "I only received part of my order. Why?",
            "text": "<p>Items aren't always stored in the same place, so an order may ship in several packages, each with its own tracking number. The rest is on its way, and you don't pay extra for it.</p><p>If the last package hasn't arrived within a week of the first, write to us.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q-16": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Tracking says delivered, but I haven't received anything.",
            "text": "<p>Ask the people you live with and your neighbours, and check your mailbox or the nearest pickup point – carriers often leave packages there and mark them as delivered.</p><p>If it still hasn't turned up, write to us within 7 days of the delivery scan, while the carrier still has the details.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q-17": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do you offer express delivery?",
            "text": "<p>Not at the moment. All orders ship free with tracked standard delivery, so we can't promise a specific date. If you have a deadline, allow 6–10 business days.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q-18": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Where do you ship, and do I pay duties?",
            "text": "<p>We ship across Canada – to every province and territory.</p><p>We cover duties, import fees and charges, so there's nothing extra to pay on delivery. We deliver to home addresses, businesses and pickup points.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q-19": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Which carriers do you use?",
            "text": "<p>We use established carriers – including Canada Post, UPS, FedEx and DHL, depending on the destination – so your package arrives safely and on time.</p>"
          }
        },
        "group-20": {
          "type": "group",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Orders and changes",
            "nav_label": "Orders and changes"
          }
        },
        "q-21": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I cancel my order?",
            "text": "<p>Yes, as long as it hasn't shipped. Email <a href=\"mailto:kontakt@stilhusetnord.dk\">kontakt@stilhusetnord.dk</a> with your order number as soon as possible – there's a short window before the order goes to the warehouse.</p><p>Once it has shipped, the quickest option is to accept the package and send it back.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q-22": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I change the shipping address?",
            "text": "<p>Only before it ships. Send us the corrected address with your order number right away, and we'll update it if the order hasn't shipped yet.</p><p>Carriers can't redirect a package once it's in their system.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q-23": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "I ordered something by mistake. Can you remove it?",
            "text": "<p>If the order hasn't shipped, yes – tell us which item and we'll remove it and refund that part. If it has shipped, it goes through the normal return process.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q-24": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Will a sold-out size come back?",
            "text": "<p>Sometimes, but we can't promise – it depends on what our makers can produce. We don't have back-in-stock alerts right now, so the newsletter is the best way to hear when a line returns.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q-25": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "I paid but didn't get a confirmation email.",
            "text": "<p>First check your spam folder, then the email address you entered at checkout – a single wrong character is the usual cause.</p><p>Still missing? Email <a href=\"mailto:kontakt@stilhusetnord.dk\">kontakt@stilhusetnord.dk</a> with the name and address you ordered under, and we'll resend it. A missing email doesn't mean the order went wrong.</p>"
          }
        },
        "group-26": {
          "type": "group",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Sizes, materials and care",
            "nav_label": "Sizes, materials and care"
          }
        },
        "q-27": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I find my size?",
            "text": "<p>Sizes vary from line to line, so go by the measurements on the product page rather than the size you usually wear.</p><p>The easiest check: lay a garment you own and like the fit of flat, measure it, and compare.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q-28": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Where can I find the exact measurements?",
            "text": "<p>In the product description, below the photos. If the measurement you need isn't there, email <a href=\"mailto:kontakt@stilhusetnord.dk\">kontakt@stilhusetnord.dk</a> with the product name and we'll find it before you order.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q-29": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I wash and care for my item?",
            "text": "<p>Follow the care label in the garment – it takes priority over any general advice.</p><p>As a rule of thumb: wash at 30°C on a gentle cycle, turn prints and dark colours inside out, skip the dryer, and dry knits flat rather than on a hanger.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
